{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は岩手県でライブでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46が岩手県でライブをするのが\n初めてでドキドキしました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろいろ思ったり\nいろいろ感じました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいことも悪いことも！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、私たちはまだまだ伸びることができる\n成長できると思いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つぎ、岩手に帰ってきたときは\n大きくなった私たちを\n皆さんに見せられるように\n明日からも頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブに来てくださった方、\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たのしかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だいすきです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ps.今日はもう時間がないので\n短いですが。。。ごめんなさい。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日、今日の分のヒナセレもやります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/04/21/5031016/0000.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}